---
// Gatekeeper bypass instructions for macOS users
// TODO: Delete this entire component when Apple notarization is complete
---

<div class="apple-platform-notice">
  <!-- Important notice banner - always visible -->
  <div class="important-notice-banner">
    <svg class="alert-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
      <path d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M12 3c-4.97 0-9 4.03-9 9s4.03 9 9 9 9-4.03 9-9-4.03-9-9-9z" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="notice-content">
      <h3 class="notice-title">⚠️ Important: First-time installation steps for all macOS users</h3>
      <p class="notice-description">
        macOS will block LifeVault on first launch because the app isn't Apple-notarized yet. 
        <strong>This is normal and safe.</strong> Follow the steps below to install successfully.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Installation instructions - always expanded -->
  <div class="help-content-area expanded">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      
      <section class="solution-section">
        <h3 class="section-heading">📋 Installation Steps (Required for All macOS Users)</h3>
        
        <div class="process-timeline">
          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-one">1</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text"><strong>Download the DMG file</strong></p>
              <p class="step-hint">Click the "Download" button above to get LifeVault-1.0.0-darwin-universal.dmg</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-two">2</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text"><strong>Install the app</strong></p>
              <p class="step-hint">Double-click the DMG file, then drag LifeVault into your Applications folder</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-step highlighted-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-three">3</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text"><strong>Bypass Gatekeeper (REQUIRED)</strong></p>
              <p class="step-hint">When you try to open LifeVault the first time, macOS will show an error saying 
              "LifeVault can't be opened because Apple cannot check it for malicious software."</p>
              <div class="substeps-container">
                <div class="substep-title">👉 Here's how to open it anyway:</div>
                <div class="substep"><strong>a)</strong> Open <strong>Finder</strong> and go to your <strong>Applications</strong> folder</div>
                <div class="substep"><strong>b)</strong> Find <strong>LifeVault</strong> in the list</div>
                <div class="substep"><strong>c)</strong> <strong>Right-click</strong> (or Control-click) on LifeVault</div>
                <div class="substep"><strong>d)</strong> Select <strong>"Open"</strong> from the menu that appears</div>
                <div class="substep"><strong>e)</strong> In the new dialog, click <strong>"Open"</strong> again to confirm</div>
                <div class="substep success-note">✅ LifeVault will now launch! You won't need to do this again.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-step">
            <div class="step-marker marker-complete">✓</div>
            <div class="step-details">
              <p class="step-text"><strong>You're all set!</strong></p>
              <p class="step-hint">LifeVault will open normally from now on. Just double-click it like any other app.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="why-section">
        <details class="why-details">
          <summary class="why-summary">❓ Why does macOS block the app?</summary>
          <div class="why-content">
            <p class="explanation-paragraph">
              Apple's <strong>Gatekeeper</strong> security system blocks apps that haven't been "notarized" 
              through Apple's developer verification program. LifeVault is an independent app and isn't 
              notarized yet (this is common for indie software).
            </p>
            <p class="explanation-paragraph">
              <strong>This warning doesn't mean the app is unsafe</strong>—it just means we're an independent 
              developer who hasn't completed Apple's verification process. We're working on getting notarized, 
              and once that's done, these extra steps won't be necessary.
            </p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section class="cli-alternative-section">
        <details class="cli-details">
          <summary class="cli-summary">🖥️ Alternative: Command-line method (advanced users)</summary>
          <div class="cli-content">
            <div class="cli-block">
              <p class="cli-intro">If you're comfortable with Terminal, you can remove the quarantine flag instead:</p>
              <div class="command-display">
                <code class="shell-command">xattr -cr /Applications/LifeVault.app</code>
              </div>
              <p class="cli-note">💡 Most users should use the right-click method described above.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .apple-platform-notice {
    margin-block: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* Important notice banner - always visible */
  .important-notice-banner {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(var(--wa) / 0.12), hsl(var(--wa) / 0.06));
    border: 2px solid hsl(var(--wa) / 0.4);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .alert-icon {
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    stroke: hsl(var(--wa));
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .notice-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .notice-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .notice-description {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.85);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Content area - always expanded */
  .help-content-area {
    display: block;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    background: hsl(var(--b1));
    border: 2px solid hsl(var(--bc) / 0.15);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
  }

  /* Installation process timeline */
  .process-timeline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .timeline-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .highlighted-step {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: hsl(var(--p) / 0.06);
    border: 2px solid hsl(var(--p) / 0.2);
    border-radius: 0.625rem;
    margin-left: -1.25rem;
    margin-right: -1.25rem;
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
    padding-right: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-marker {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .marker-one,
  .marker-two,
  .marker-three {
    background: hsl(var(--p));
    color: hsl(var(--pc));
  }

  .marker-complete {
    background: hsl(var(--su));
    color: hsl(var(--suc));
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-details {
    flex: 1;
    padding-top: 0.375rem;
  }

  .step-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .step-hint {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.7);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .substeps-container {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: hsl(var(--b2) / 0.5);
    border-left: 3px solid hsl(var(--p));
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .substep-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .substep {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.8);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .substep strong {
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .success-note {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: hsl(var(--su));
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: hsl(var(--su) / 0.1);
    border-radius: 0.375rem;
  }

  /* Why section - collapsible */
  .why-section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .why-details {
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--bc) / 0.15);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .why-summary {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.8);
    background: hsl(var(--b2) / 0.3);
    list-style: none;
    user-select: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .why-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .why-summary:hover {
    background: hsl(var(--b2) / 0.5);
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
  }

  .why-content {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: hsl(var(--b1));
  }

  .explanation-paragraph {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.8);
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .explanation-paragraph:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* CLI section - collapsible */
  .cli-alternative-section {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .cli-details {
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--bc) / 0.15);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cli-summary {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.7);
    background: hsl(var(--b2) / 0.3);
    list-style: none;
    user-select: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .cli-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .cli-summary:hover {
    background: hsl(var(--b2) / 0.5);
    color: hsl(var(--bc));
  }

  .cli-content {
    background: hsl(var(--b1));
  }

  .cli-block {
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .cli-intro {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.75);
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .command-display {
    background: hsl(var(--n));
    color: hsl(var(--nc));
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--bc) / 0.1);
  }

  .shell-command {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', 'Source Code Pro', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .cli-note {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.65);
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    * {
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .important-notice-banner {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .highlighted-step {
      margin-left: -1rem;
      margin-right: -1rem;
      padding-left: 2rem;
      padding-right: 1rem;
    }

    .step-marker {
      width: 2.25rem;
      height: 2.25rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
  }
</style>
